[I] Extension to GCOV providing a graphical frontend for converage information

[T] LCOV is an extension to GCOV. It provides a graphical frontend for converage information.

[U] https://github.com/linux-test-project/lcov

[A] Lcov Authors
[M] René Rebe <rene@exactco.de>

[C] extra/base
